# Trivy scan suppressions for false positives

# AVD-KSV-0109: False positive - "bypass" is a boolean configuration flag, not a secret
# ConfigMap contains admin.bypass boolean for enabling admin group bypass feature
# This is documented configuration, not sensitive data
AVD-KSV-0109

# CVE-2026-21728, CVE-2026-28377: Grafana Tempo (fixed in 2.10.3).
# We pin Tempo v2.10.10 (commit f317720e7e51), which includes both fixes.
# Tempo release tags use a module path Go can't resolve by semver, so go.mod
# has a pseudo-version (v1.5.1-0.20261021135948-f317720e7e51). Trivy compares
# that against 2.10.3 and wrongly reports it as older.
# Remove these lines when we move to github.com/grafana/tempo/v3.
CVE-2026-21728
CVE-2026-28377
